x:1945](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/blueprint/src/chapter/ch15_qpbt_combining.tex:1945). The first two Lean declarations quantify over every real `delta` and require both `S.IsProjective` and projective polynomial measurements at [Defect.lean:106](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/DirectLowDegree/Transport/Consistency/Defect.lean:106) and [Defect.lean:192](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/DirectLowDegree/Transport/Consistency/Defect.lean:192). The third declaration does not require `S.IsProjective` at [Defect.lean:283](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/DirectLowDegree/Transport/Consistency/Defect.lean:283). State `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u03b4 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2208 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u211d`, call the polynomial measurements projective, and restrict projectivity of the strategy to the first two items, potentially by splitting the entry.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nF2 is the explicit indexing mismatch: [ch15_qpbt_combining.tex:1949](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/blueprint/src/chapter/ch15_qpbt_combining.tex:1949) uses `r \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2208 {1,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2026,k}`, while the Lean declarations use `r : Fin D.k`, hence `r \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2208 {0,\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2026,k-1}`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nF3 invalidates the compression block\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2019s statement-level status. The linked declarations at [Compression.lean:322](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/DirectLowDegree/Transport/Consistency/Compression.lean:322) and [Compression.lean:360](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/MIPStarRE/QPBT/Combining/DirectLowDegree/Transport/Consistency/Compression.lean:360) prove the two mixed compression identities only. They do not formalize the assertion that the two global/global quantities do not bound one another. Move [the negative assertion](/home/drx/MIPStarRE-qpbt/.worktrees/issue-132-ld-consistency-conversion/blueprint/src/chapter/ch15_qpbt_combining.tex:2008) into a separate remark without `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\leanok`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nFor F4 and F5, both new lemma blocks end without proof environments. All five linked Lean theorems are completed; their axiom reports contain only `propext`, `Classical.choice`, and `Quot.sound`. After correcting F1-F3, add concise `proof` environments carrying proof-level `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\leanok`.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nFor F6, replace \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cmature low individual degree test interface\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cmature lines\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cmature `ProjStrat`\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cadapters\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, and \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cmature branch weights\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d with \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201clow individual degree test\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cLDT lines\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201can LDT projective strategy\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cconstructions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d, and \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cLDT branch weights\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d. This wording was reintroduced by the latest merge.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nFor F7, drop \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cexported\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d: \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cThe following identities identify \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u2026\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d states the mathematics directly. For F8, replace \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cexpressed in the LDT state interface\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d with \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201cregarded as an LDT pure state.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u201d\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\nThe new `ldGame` statement-level `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\leanok` is accurate, and the existing `\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\